        "name": "@bananiceee/dsh-status-bar",
        "title": "@bananiceee/dsh-status-bar",
        "description": "DSH 底栏管理插件：原生底部状态栏超长、内容易被截断；本插件提供接近原生体验的可配置状态栏——16 个信息段任意开关/排序，并带换行、实时 TPS、费用估算等多项实用选项（适配 DSH 0.2.1）。The native DSH bottom status bar is too long and parts get truncated; this plugin delivers a near-native, fully configurable status bar — 16 toggleable/reorderable segments, plus useful options such as wrapping, live TPS and cost estimation (DSH 0.2.1).",
